					καρφαλέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					5.369
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέρμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Aph.</u>
					5.71
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Prog.</u>
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.674
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστάχυες, ἄρουρα</span>, <i><span class="en">
